  "display_title": "Tenth Time's the Charm",
  "description": "A shy returning student who loves caring for flowers, Hyunwoo has a condition that makes him pass out in the presence of excessive stimuli. For example, he nearly fainted at a bar recently because of some freshman who’d doused himself in cologne. Thankfully, he got some fresh air in time, as well as a glimpse of that same freshman making out with another guy. Hyunwoo doesn’t think much of it, but a few days later, he’s overwhelmed by the same dizzying yet irresistible scent. But this time, he’s not at a bar—he’s at a flower-themed cafe, to interview for a job he desperately wants and needs. What will Hyunwoo find in this garden of memories? \n\n(Source: Lezhin)",
